      "id": "claim_fc27d817d7154451b906b35f645e873d",
      "statement": "After external preparation, concat_shards_to_cache orders manifest shard records by numeric index, copies the listed files in bounded reads, and atomically installs the flat cache with os.replace; missing or empty manifests raise SystemExit instead of producing an empty cache.",
