    {
      "id": "claim_0ec09601cd6842e1bebb45b2496bf93e",
      "statement": "The runtime cache is a raw uint32 stream opened read-only with np.memmap; PackedDataset exposes non-overlapping seq_len-plus-one windows as shifted input and target tensors, while the training sampler is reproducibly shuffled and validation is ordered.",
